{
  "_about": "Shortcuts of scripts that are NOT in this repo, for tools/hotkey_audit.py and the Settings window's clash warnings. 'running' = scripts expected to run next to RadGesture. 'retire' = scripts that must be closed because RadGesture took over their keys: Rad Optimizer's functions are RadGesture's Functions now (config/library.json). Keys and actions only: no links or login variables. 'sends' = keys a script presses into an app.",
  "running": [],
